{"2913940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solstice", "steam_appid": 2913940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "Help Poppy as she journeys through unknown lands in search for her lost sister. Secrets lie ahead, as not everything is originally as it seems...  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913940/extras/91d7abca017781a35985afa3e58ada21.poster.avif?t=1761596594\" width=600 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913940/extras/91d7abca017781a35985afa3e58ada21.webm?t=1761596594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2913940/extras/91d7abca017781a35985afa3e58ada21.mp4?t=1761596594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><br>Solstice is an emotional yet action-packed journey of self-discovery, forgiveness and acceptance. <br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story-driven, top-down adventure as you journey through a portal to mysterious worlds, encountering unique enemies and crafting exciting weapons and armour along the way.<br></li><li>Keep an eye out, different worlds contain different resources that can be dropped, mined, collected, fished and more!<br><br><br></li><li>Build houses, craft weapons and make other-Worldly discoveries.<br></li><li>Discover new and interesting people who will assist you on your journey.<br></li><li>Dodge, Shoot, Roll, Slice, Chop, Heal, Craft, and Cry in this action-packed adventure!</li></ul><br><i>Sisters are different flowers from the same garden</i>", "about_the_game": "Help Poppy as she journeys through unknown lands in search for her lost sister. Secrets lie ahead, as not everything is originally as it seems...  <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m